<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>15th Down Scouting Ireland</title>

<style>
body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #eef4ed;
    color: #173b25;
}

header {
    background: #173b25;
    color: white;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
}

nav a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin: 5px;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 10px 15px;
    background: #2d6840;
    border-radius: 20px;
}

.hero {
    background: #2d6840;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 80px 20px;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-size: 42px;
}

.button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #f0b429;
    color: #173b25;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    margin-top: 15px;
    border-radius: 25px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
}

section {
    padding: 50px 20px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: auto;
    text-align: center;
}

.cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    padding: 25px;
    width: 220px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
}

.icon {
    font-size: 40px;
}

.documents {
    background: #e1ebdf;
    max-width: none;
}

.contact {
    background: #173b25;
    color: white;
    max-width: none;
}

.contact h2 {
    color: white;
}

footer {
    background: #102819;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>

<h2>🌲 15th Down Scouting Ireland</h2>

<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#about">About Us</a>
<a href="#activities">Activities</a>
<a href="#adventure">Adventure</a>
<a href="#documents">Documents</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

</header>


<div class="hero" id="home">

<h1>🌲 15th Down Scouting Ireland</h1>

<p>Adventure • Friendship • Skills • Community</p>

<p>
Welcome to 15th Down Scouting Ireland.
</p>

<a href="#about" class="button">
Explore Our Scouts 🧭
</a>

</div>


<section id="about">

<h2>🧭 About Us</h2>

<p>
15th Down Scouting Ireland is all about adventure, teamwork,
learning and having fun.
</p>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🤝</div>
<h3>Teamwork</h3>
<p>Working together and supporting each other.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🌲</div>
<h3>Outdoors</h3>
<p>Exploring the countryside and enjoying the outdoors.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">⭐</div>
<h3>Personal Growth</h3>
<p>Learning skills and becoming more confident.</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>


<section id="activities">

<h2>🔥 Activities</h2>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🏕️</div>
<h3>Camping</h3>
<p>Experience life outdoors.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🔥</div>
<h3>Campfires</h3>
<p>Games, stories and memories.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🥾</div>
<h3>Hiking</h3>
<p>Explore trails and new places.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🧭</div>
<h3>Navigation</h3>
<p>Learn maps and compass skills.</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>


<section id="adventure">

<h2>🥾 Adventure & Skills</h2>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🪢</div>
<h3>Knots</h3>
<p>Learn useful knots and pioneering skills.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🗺️</div>
<h3>Map Reading</h3>
<p>Learn how to read maps and plan routes.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🚑</div>
<h3>First Aid</h3>
<p>Learn important first-aid skills.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🏆</div>
<h3>Challenges</h3>
<p>Take on new challenges.</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>


<section class="documents" id="documents">

<h2>📄 Documents</h2>

<p>Useful documents for 15th Down Scouting Ireland.</p>

<div class="cards">


<div class="card">

<div class="icon">📋</div>

<h3>Permission Forms</h3>

<p>View the permission form.</p>

<a href="permission-form.pdf"
class="button"
target="_blank">
📄 View PDF
</a>

</div>


<div class="card">

<div class="icon">🏕️</div>

<h3>Camp Information</h3>

<p>Important camp information.</p>

<a href="camp-information.pdf"
class="button"
target="_blank">
📄 View PDF
</a>

</div>


<div class="card">

<div class="icon">🧭</div>

<h3>Adventure Skills Handbook</h3>

<p>Outdoor skills and scouting knowledge.</p>

<a href="Adventure-skills-handbook.pdf"
class="button"
target="_blank">
📖 View Handbook
</a>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<section class="contact" id="contact">

<h2>📧 Contact Us</h2>

<p>
Want to find out more about 15th Down Scouting Ireland?
</p>

<a href="mailto:15thdownscouts@gmail.com"
class="button">
Contact Us 📧
</a>

</section>


<footer>

<p>🌲 15th Down Scouting Ireland</p>

<p>Adventure • Skills • Friendship • Community</p>

<p>© 2026 15th Down Scouting Ireland</p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
